"""
Smart Bot - VEX Ordering System
================================

Flowchart / logic design
------------------------
START
  |
  V
Welcome the user and explain the VEX ordering system
  |
  V
Ask: What parts would you like to order?
  |
  +-- if a part is found in the VEX database
  |       -> add it to the cart
  |
  +-- else
          -> tell the user to try a valid product name or SKU
  |
  V
Ask: Would you like to add more parts?
  |
  +-- yes -> return to the part selection step
  |
  +-- no -> move to checkout
  |
  V
Display the order summary and total price
  |
  V
Ask: Would you like to confirm the order?
  |
  +-- yes -> ask for an email address and send the order summary
  |
  +-- no -> cancel the order and exit
  |
  V
END

This script uses:
- lowercase normalization
- tokenization with word_tokenize()
- NLTK tokenization and lemmatisation when available, with offline fallbacks
- while-loop ordering flow
- checkout + confirmation + email sending
"""

